<title>NETHERLANDS: DUTCH BONDS CLOSE MIXED AFTER BUBA, EYES ON U.S..</title>
<headline>DUTCH BONDS CLOSE MIXED AFTER BUBA, EYES ON U.S..</headline>
<text>
<p>---------------------(Snapshot at 1530 GMT)---------------------</p>
<p>* DUTCH STATE LOANS	 PRICES			  BID YIELDS</p>
<p>  June 1999 7.50 pct	106.11/21 (-0.05)	   3.95 (+0.01)</p>
