<p>-------------------------(August 12)----------------------------</p>
<p>* Dutch bonds close mixed with longer end solidly higher after relief Buba maintains fixed rate repo at three percent.</p>
<p>Guilders lag Bunds as curve starts to flatten markedly again.</p>
<p>Dealers see market watching U.S. in next few days for July data, particularly worried about retail sales on Wednesday.</p>
